{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgF8ceRTY7kEre1DQMsV7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"prompt\": \"A purely nonrepresentational abstract painting, square format, filling the entire image edge to edge with no frame, no wall, no room, and no gallery setting. No recognizable objects, figures, faces, bodies, scenes, landscapes, horizons, machines, diagrams, symbols, icons, letters, numbers, or text. Composition: a dense, deep indigo-black field at the lower left, pushed up against a cluster of hot vermilion and ochre strokes that rise diagonally toward the upper right, as if pressing against a boundary. Several thin, luminous cobalt and pale turquoise lines weave between them in looping, interrupted rhythms, some layered translucently over the darker mass and some breaking off into raw, unfinished edges. Brushwork varies sharply: broad, loaded palette-knife sweeps in the center, dry-brush scraping at the edges, and a few drips running downward that slow and thicken. Texture ranges from smooth, glazed passages to thick impasto ridges and areas where the canvas shows through. Spatial tension comes from a small, bright magenta mass held off-center, with a band of empty, pale gray space opening in the upper left that the eye keeps returning to. High contrast between the saturated and the muted, with a restless, gestural energy overall and a sense of layers in motion rather than a settled resolution.\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":579,"cache_read_input_tokens":18143,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":579},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"19284a4c-6747-4b0a-b9a5-ec3b000d997c","uuid":"1